
>> ⚄ := Yam-khoom tshiab.

⚄ thaum-tuaj: ['hom'] ua: { <- ['Object'].
}.

Tawm sau-ntawv: ['⇿?↵'] ? ⚄ hom.
Tawm sau-ntawv: ['⇿?↵'] ? Lub-sijhawm hom.
Tawm sau-ntawv: ['⇿?↵'] ? Kev-pab-cuam-khoos-phis-tawj hom.
Tawm sau-ntawv: ['⇿?↵'] ? (1 ≠ 2).
Tawm sau-ntawv: ['⇿?↵'] ? (2 ≥ 1).
Tawm sau-ntawv: ['⇿?↵'] ? (1 ≤ 2).
